---
// Template drafted for Wi-Fi Pros; have a lawyer review before relying on it.
import Layout from "../components/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import { business } from "../data/business";

const lastUpdated = "August 1, 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Wi-Fi Pros"
  description="How Wi-Fi Pros Network Consulting collects, uses, and protects the information you share through our contact and quote request forms."
>
  <Section border={false} class="pt-20">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-slate max-w-xl text-lg">
      Last updated: {lastUpdated}
    </p>
  </Section>

  <Section>
    <div class="article-body max-w-2xl">
      <p>
        {business.legalName} ("we," "us," or "our") operates the wifipros.ca
        website (the "Site"). This policy explains what information we
        collect when you visit the Site or use our contact and quote request
        forms, how we use it, and the choices you have.
      </p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        We only collect information that you choose to give us. We do not use
        cookies, analytics, or any tracking technology on the Site, and we do
        not passively collect browsing data.
      </p>
      <p>When you use our <strong>contact form</strong>, we collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your name</li>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>Phone number (optional)</li>
        <li>The message you send us</li>
      </ul>
      <p>When you use our <strong>quote request form</strong>, we collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Whether the request is residential or business</li>
        <li>
          The services you're interested in (Wi-Fi/network, cameras, door
          access, audio, or network storage)
        </li>
        <li>
          Property details — existing wiring, internet provider, outbuildings,
          and approximate building size
        </li>
        <li>Your name, email address, and phone number (optional)</li>
        <li>Your city and postal code</li>
        <li>Your preferred timeline</li>
        <li>A floorplan file, if you choose to upload one (optional)</li>
        <li>Any other details you provide</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information you provide to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to your inquiry or message</li>
        <li>Prepare and follow up on quote requests</li>
        <li>Schedule site visits, calls, or consultations</li>
        <li>Plan and deliver the services you request from us</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We do not use your information for advertising, and we do not sell or
        rent it to third parties.
      </p>

      <h2>How Your Information Is Handled</h2>
      <p>
        Our contact and quote request forms are processed by{" "}
        <a
          href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Netlify
        </a>, the company that hosts the Site, and delivered to us by email.
        We don't operate our own database or CRM for form submissions beyond
        what Netlify stores on our behalf.
      </p>
      <p>
        The Site loads fonts from Google Fonts. Loading a font makes a request
        to Google's servers, which may log your IP address as part of normal web
        delivery — we don't control this and don't receive any information from
        it ourselves.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not currently use Google Analytics or any other analytics or
        advertising tool. If that changes in the future, we'll update this
        policy before doing so.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Retention</h2>
      <p>
        We keep form submissions for as long as reasonably necessary to respond
        to your inquiry, deliver any services you request, and meet our own
        recordkeeping and legal obligations. You can ask us to delete your
        information at any time — see "Your Rights" below.
      </p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under Alberta's Personal Information Protection Act and Canada's federal
        privacy law (PIPEDA), you have the right to ask what personal
        information we hold about you, request a correction, or request that we
        delete it. To do so, contact us using the details below.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        We take reasonable steps to protect the information you share with us,
        but no method of electronic storage or transmission is completely
        secure, and we can't guarantee absolute security.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        The Site is intended for adults seeking home or business networking
        services. We do not knowingly collect information from children.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on
        this page with an updated "Last updated" date.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this policy or want to exercise any of the
        rights described above, contact us at{" "}
        <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a> or{" "}
        <a href={`tel:${business.phone.replace(/[^\d+]/g, "")}`}>
          {business.phone}
        </a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Section>
</Layout>
